                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "For a 1 man dev, this game is pretty solid!! You can tell with the item/object placement, the voice acting along with the story they dev tried. Batteries are placed just right for new players geting into a horror/survival game. This game has some interesting concepts and that one was \"using a lighter near gas can will explode\". Only downs about this game was, in the cave i had massive framerate drops (HIGH END PC I HAVE). Monster is always in a default position and gets stuck on objects.\n\nPros\nLayout of the area was well planned\nyou have lighter and flashlight\nsteam trading cards & achievements\nController\nAtmosphere beautiful (Power of U4)\nvr game\n\nCons\nbug* Wouldnt allow me to save in save area.\nmonster is always in a default position\nmonster gets trapped on objects\n1 type of enemy\nvoice acting was poor. Voice was low. (USE PASSION!!)",
